currentPositions.description:
My role focuses on client relationship management, drive revenue growth by developing strategic sales plans and initiatives, and expanding our market presence. The objective is to build lasting client relationships and drive substantial business growth through meticulous planning, and a deep understanding of the private aviation industry in order to position 365 Aviation as a leader in the private aviation industry.

Key responsibilities include:

- Develop and implement effective sales plans to meet or exceed company revenue targets;

- Identify, develop, and maintain relationships with new prospects and key corporate clients;

- Guide, train, and support junior sales team members to enhance performance and professional development;

- Monitor market trends, competitor activities, and industry developments to identify opportunities for growth and improvement;

- Explore new market opportunities, develop strategic partnerships, and enhance the company’s footprint in the private jet sector;
